    <p>No governing-law venue is specified on this public Site because the operating legal entity and jurisdiction are not identified here. Any mandatory protections applicable to you remain in force. Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:venuuu.nyc@proton.me">venuuu.nyc@proton.me</a>.</p>
